window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I thought nothing was worse than dying. Then I discovered there are things that hurt an awful lot more than chemo—like getting your heart trampled on by the insanely powerful superhuman prince who claims you’re his mate. Right after we consummated the mating, no less.</p> <p>Well, he can have a nice life. The moment an opportunity presents itself, I’m out of here.</p> <p>I just need to locate someone who’ll portal me back to Earth before he finds me.</p>"; 
